  DisplayName: A Spanish Convent Sells Its Treasury
  EventType: 1
  Description: A poor convent in Castile {has been|will be} given leave to sell its
    treasury to repair the roof. Altar silver and old vestments {are offered|will
    be offered} to the trade, and the sale {is drawing|will draw} fresh attention
    to Spanish work of the period.
